 "text": "Auditor\nOctober 18, 2026\nMoody County, South Dakota\nHome\nAbout\nDepartments »\nAuditor\nEmergency Management\nEqualization\nExtension\nHighway\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff’s Department\nState’s Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeteran’s Office\nZoning\nCommissioners »\nCommission Agenda\nCommission Minutes\nCounty Ordinances\nEmployment\nQuick Links\nYou are here: Home / Auditor\nAuditor\nAuditor: Tawny Heinemann\nDeputy Auditor: Ashley Headrick\nAuditor Clerk: Angela Klein\nMailing Address:\nMoody County Auditor\n101 E Pipestone Ave. Suite D\nFlandreau, SD 57028\nPhone : (605) 997-3161\nFax: (605) 997-9996\nEmail: auditor@moodycounty.net\nOffice Hours : M-F 8:00-5:00\nLocation: 2nd Floor, Courthouse\nThe County Auditor, as the clerk of the County Commission, is required to keep records of Commission proceedings. The Auditor’s fiscal duties include conducting a monthly verification of all bank balances and cash items in the County Treasurer’s Office and making a report of the same to the Commission, preparing warrants for all disbursements, publishing an annual report of the receipts and disbursements as well as the assets and liabilities of the County, and keeping inventory of County property. The Auditor also assists the Board with the annual budget and calculates the annual levies.\nElection duties include voter registration, ballot preparation, appointment and training of election officials, canvassing and making abstracts of the votes cast, and issuing certificates of election.\nElection Information, Voter Registration, and Absentee Ballot Application:\nhttp://sdsos.gov/Elections/Default.aspx\nVoter Registration Form\nAbsentee Ballot Application\nVoter Information Portal: View your polling location, sample ballot and current registration information\nPrecinct Map\nPolling Places\nMost Recent Audit Report\n2027 Provisional Budget- Budget Hearing 09/01 9:05 AM\n2026 Budget\nPT74 2025 pay 2026\nPT74 2024 pay 2025\nTax Apportioning Statements\nCommission Meeting October 20, 2026 9:00 am – 11:00 am\nTabulator Test October 27, 2026 3:00 pm – 4:00 pm\nGeneral Election November 3, 2026 7:00 am – 7:00 pm\nCommission Meeting – Election Canvass November 9, 2026 9:00 am – 11:00 am\nWeather\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in",
